OL,3,GNEWSA'Nature will recover' from tidal
OL,4,Abarrage, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Nature will recover" if a tidal
OL,7,Fbarrage is built across the River
OL,8,FMersey, Liverpool's mayor has said, but
OL,9,Fhe acknowledged environmental
OL,10,Fcampaigners had "legitimate concerns"
OL,11,Fabout the project.
OL,13,FThe proposed barrage would harness the
OL,14,Ftidal power of the Mersey to generate
OL,15,Felectricity, but two wildlife charities
OL,16,Fhave said it could be "highly damaging
OL,17,Ffor the environment".
OL,19,FSteve Rotheram recently revealed the
OL,20,Fpreferred location would link
OL,21,FBromborough in Wirral and Otterspool in
OL,22,FLiverpool.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
