OL,3,GNEWSA'Nature will recover' from tidal
OL,4,Abarrage, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the barrage could act as part
OL,7,Fof the region's flood defences, which
OL,8,Fwould protect wildlife from rising sea
OL,9,Flevels but promised there would be a
OL,10,F"full and proper consultation".
